    "description": {
      "en": "This constant is labelled as Aragón's regional minimum-income basic amount for a one-person household, defined in bsarg_es and recorded on a yearly basis (802 EUR/year at the latest of 7 values since 2016-01-01). It is used once, as the Comp_perTU parameter in bsarg_es's BenCalc for '24 - Aragón: GMI amount'. The country report describes an annually-set one-person basic amount for Aragón's scheme, with the pre-October-2021 Ingreso Aragonés de Inserción capped at the minimum wage and its 2022-2025 successor (Prestación Aragonesa Complementaria del IMV) instead running from 540 to 700 EUR per month — figures that do not obviously reconcile with this constant's 802 EUR/year value, so it may reflect an earlier point in the series or a differently-scaled quantity; confidence is lowered accordingly."
    },
